  "steps": [
    "In a bowl, whisk together the besan, salt, black pepper, red chilli flakes, mixed herbs, and enough water to make a smooth, pourable batter (slightly thinner than dosa batter).",
    "Heat a non-stick pan and add the chopped mushrooms without any oil. Cook for 2–3 minutes until they release their moisture and turn lightly golden.",
    "Add the spinach and cherry tomatoes. Season with a pinch of salt and pepper, then sauté for another 1–2 minutes. Remove the veggies from the pan and set aside.",
    "Lightly spray the pan with oil and pour in the besan batter and spread it into a large omlette (not too thin or it will become crispy).",
    "Once the omlette is about halfway cooked evenly grate the High Protein Paneer over the top and gently press it down with a spatula.",
    "When the omlette is cooked, place the sautéed vegetables over one half and top them with the cheese slice.",
    "Cover with a lid and cook on low heat for 2 minutes, until the cheese has melted.",
    "Fold the omlette, drizzle with your favourite hot sauce, and enjoy!"
  ],
